{
 "name": "Wilderness step W1.4, two players (run with wilderness-pvp-ranged-test.json on the other VM at the same time): test2, on 99 hitpoints at level 50 with auto retaliate off, takes test's sure 12 from its shortbow",
 "account": "test2",
 "steps": [
  {"step": "waitForLogin"},
